                content: "Automated KYC/AML lets investors onboard in under 2 hours, fast and frictionless." }, {
                title: "Distributions are such a pain tracking, calculating, sending… isn’t there a better way?" ,
                content: "Smart contracts automate payouts completely, with no manual work and no reconciliation headaches."
